        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "老范当上了保洁员，有一种老干部的气质。在难民营困了将近两年，终于有个劳务公司帮我办了工作许可。今天第一次上班，整整八个小时，喝水的时间都没有。尽管做保洁体力不重，但是连续八个小时干下来还是腰酸背痛。坚持下去，习惯了就好了。为了老婆孩子不挨饿，拼上老命也得干下去。\n\nLao Fan became a cleaner, and I have the temperament of an old cadre. After being trapped in the refugee camp for nearly two years, a labor service company finally helped me get a work permit. Today was my first time working, and I worked for a full eight hours without even having time to drink water. Although cleaning is not physically very hard, I still feel backache after working for eight hours straight. Just keep going, and I will get used to it. In order to keep my wife and children from starving, I have to keep working even if it costs my life."
